  "",
  "A Baoa Qu is the name",
  "of a Zeon space fortress",
  "on a par with Solomon.",
  "A Baoa Qu.",
  "A strange name.",
  "The books tell us it names",
  "an imaginary beast, the guide",
  "who guards the Tower of Victory.",
  "No doubt someone",
  "thought of a glorious future",
  "when they gave it that name.",
  "That it would become",
  "a cruel irony, surely no one",
  "imagined at the time.",
  "After Solomon fell,",
  "the line linking A Baoa Qu",
  "and the moon was declared",
  "the final line of defense.",
  "A line that did not really exist.",
  "Given the distance from",
  "A Baoa Qu to the moon, it was",
  "far too long to be held.",
  "A fleet could easily have",
  "crossed this defense line",
  "and invaded Side 3,",
  "the Zeon homeland.",
  "And yet,",
  "in reality, the battle",
  "was fought at the stronghold",
  "of A Baoa Qu.",
  "Records mention no fleet battles",
  "of note before or after it.",
  "Why, then, was the battle",
  "fought at A Baoa Qu?",
  "It was fought",
  "to bring down a single man.",
  "Meanwhile, in the Zeon homeland.",
  "The forced evacuation",
  "of Mahal's 1.5 million residents",
